# eNOTIF
## Electronic Notification System for Foreshore Lease Administration

Version: 1.0
Organization: Department of Environment and Natural Resources (DENR)
Region: Region VIII
Project Type: Internal Web Application

---

# Project Overview

eNOTIF (Electronic Notification System) is an internal web-based application developed for the Department of Environment and Natural Resources (DENR) to automate the monitoring and collection of annual Foreshore Lease Agreement (FLA) rental payments.

The system addresses delayed payment collections caused by lessees forgetting payment schedules by automatically notifying DENR personnel and lessees before payment deadlines.

This system is intended ONLY for authorized DENR personnel and is not accessible to the public.

---

# Project Goal

Increase annual rental collection efficiency by automating:

- Billing reminders
- Internal notifications
- Demand letters
- Payment monitoring
- Collection reporting

