## Notification Module

Runs automatically every day.

Rules

### 10 Days Before Due

Notify

- Assigned PENRO
- Assigned CENRO
- Cashier
- Lessee

---

### 3 Days Before Due

Send reminder email to lessee.

---

### Due Date

If payment exists

Status becomes

PAID

Otherwise

FOR PAYMENT

---

### After Due Date

If unpaid

Status becomes

OVERDUE

Automatically generate demand letter.

Notify

- PENRO
- Cashier

